abstract: >-
  An isolated executable POC of the v189 GCL LAW-0 uncertainty ledger. The
  artifact preserves the production crate byte-for-byte, demonstrates in
  bounded executable cases local tuple
  non-expansion and atomic rejection, reproduces global continuity, phase-order,
  and numeric-domain gaps, and defines a bounded architecture-preserving
  advancement method.
